    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's the honey drink I'm talking about. It's got a sweet taste at first, but I didn't expect it to hit me so hard after!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't really all that bad, though. My friend said I was honey drunk, but in the end, I was as sober as can be, and she was totally wasted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Hey? Dedushka?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Are you listening?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#16$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forgive me, Rosalind. What did you just say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was totally blitzed on honey!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right, right. Of course, on honey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... c'mon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you have something on your mind, you should just deal with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're barely even here. How are we supposed to have a conversation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, there is nothing more worthy of my attention than your story right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, tell me more about honey drunkenness. If I recall correctly, they do offer specialty beverages made with honey on this train.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, that's enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "My eyes are pretty sharp. You've been acting weird since that guy in the hat showed up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he your friend...? No, you don't look like friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you must be enemies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not quite.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps the two of us can just barely be described as colleagues. We don't work for the same department of the company, however.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, so he's a colleague you don't get along with, bumping into you on vacation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I love the way you describe it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right then, Rosalind. I'll admit I'm a little worried my colleague may not get his work done quite satisfactorily, so please excuse me for a short while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "By way of apology, I will secure for you a honey beverage. Its main ingredient is a Kjerag specialty, highland honey. Each and every drop is Kjeragandr's blessing, pure and unadulterated...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? I'm pretty much desensitized to all that Kjeragandr marketing talk though...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without a doubt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you did tell me your friend said you get honey drunk, so I'd like us to make a promise to one other. One bottle per day, at most. Let's keep you from actually getting drunk on our trip.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
