    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need for things to be so tense between us, Madam Degenbrecher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Grace's heart lies with Karlan Trade, and she is also keenly interested in Kjerag's continued development. It is my job to keep an eye on all aspects of the country.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is no different. There's no reason for you to be on alert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So your job description includes visiting train cabins?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The changes this place has been through are quite shocking, are they not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "From what I understand, they've deployed Victorian rolling stock on this route extending from the foot of Mount Karlan to Lake Silberneherze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this series of trains has gone through significant modification since its initial deployment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the first to sow the seeds in all this, Her Grace is struck with admiration for Karlan Trade's technological improvements in these three short years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Gnosis hadn't done all this, then Enciodes would've been in deep trouble after speaking up for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going to discuss technology with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're talking to the wrong person, then. Better find Gnosis yourself. He might be interested.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most curious, Madam.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did not expect to find you here, much less under these circumstances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who exactly is it that necessitated your personal intervention? What kind of situation could be so urgent and precarious that... you haven't even the time to change your bloodstained gloves?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dealt with a small issue, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not the right time for your curiosity, Trilby Asher, and I suggest you abandon it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm here looking for someone, and I don't want to dirty another pair of gloves for the time being.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean no offense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I don't mean to interfere with your work in any way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just... surely there must be someone important aboard?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if there is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you wouldn't mind divulging some details to me, perhaps I could be of some assistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all... finding people is one of the tasks that we handle on a day-to-day basis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You seem to be mistaken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I beg your pardon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enciodes might be willing to turn a blind eye to you sticking your nose here. That's his choice, and none of my business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I don't share his patience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know what's so much nicer about Kjerag than Kazimierz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The place is cold, but consequently, there aren't as many insects around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "The flying ones buzz around until you can't help but squash them dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now you'd best behave yourself, or I will act in Enciodes's stead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for the advice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Trilby Asher'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not advice. It's a warning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough chit-chat. Are you through wasting my time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What luck, the man I'm looking for is eavesdropping on the other side of that door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
