    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Before he can finish his sentence, a flash of cold, white light sweeps past his field of vision."
    },
    {
        "text": "The pressure the Trilby Asher managed to exert is suppressed within himself. The signature hat on his head is suddenly split into two down its brim, at last revealing a hint of the fear the disguised spy is feeling."
    },
    {
        "text": "The woman's hand rests on her weapon, apparently casually. Her gaze makes it clear to the Trilby Asher that\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, he is prey to a ferocious beast."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want this train decommissioned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't make me say it again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'd rather I make my own way, that would be fine, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Degenbrecher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
