    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This has certainly got to be a joke!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The Black Knight in the flesh... In Kazimierz, they would print the image of the bloodied Black Knight on rare foil cards!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Set the Trilby Asher aside... Even the Black Knight is on this train...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Oh, and me\u2014A Victorian viscount, personally named by the Black Knight as the one she's looking for. What a star-studded cast! Inconceivable!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "(......)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I need somebody to tell me right now this is all some kind of impromptu entertainment... That's what I need!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lisburn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need you to check for me right now if Karlan Trade has made any strange moves\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, never mind. First, make sure our men are safe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#15$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our men? They're all fine in the barracks. We all went back after we chauffeured you to the station. Saw nothing strange whatsoever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Jefferson and the lads are not yet back from their drinking contest... I'll have someone find them right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter, Harold? The way you're talking, is something up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything is fine for now. For now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope I'm merely overthinking this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, confirm their status and have them report in immediately! Even if they've drunk themselves to death, pick them back up and get them to report in before they drop dead again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#15$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood. I'm on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seasoned Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "O Kjeragandr, if you're really omnipresent and omniscient as the people here say\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now is the time for you to appear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please don't abandon a faithful traveler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can't be a good, proper guest, I may have no choice but to be an unwelcome guest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
