        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's the gist of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "The signal here is kinda wonky. I gave it a try, but I got almost no signal at all in the cabin. It's a little better in the corridor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing Aurora set this up for us ahead of time. Otherwise, I probably wouldn't have a way to get in touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What could happen to me? Relax, I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright! I'll leave it to you to get in touch with the landship. Say hello to the others for me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll hang up now. Later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
