    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$chasing_intro",
        "key": "$chasing_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#15$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A shame. Seems we won't have much time for an explanation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosalind, you go on back to the cabin\u2014Wait, no, you can't. The Trilby Asher has already seen you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Besides, he said she looked 'familiar'...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Trilby Asher? You mean your colleague with the weird hat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, exactly. That's him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "I ran into some small trouble, Rosalind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me say this now. It was not my intent to bring you into this mess. However...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want some strange man to come propositioning you because he's failed to find me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Propositioning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just ignore those weirdos. And if they can't take a hit, I sock 'em right in the nose!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a bad idea. If ever you find the chance, please do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there are certain men who don't give up simply because they've been punched in the face by a young lady...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, I'd like to offer you an invitation to the dining car, to sample the honey beverages there and evade the stubborn flirts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, so you mean you want to drink honey with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, let us proceed to imbibe the honey drink.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you want to run all the way there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, yes, let us proceed to run all the way there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, they've almost caught up to you, haven't they? I can hear their footsteps!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really aren't hiding none of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4114_harold_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I said as much. I would never lie to a lady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harold"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I've got no idea what kind of ruckus you guys are stirring up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_194_leto_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
